{
  "title": "Shooting Party",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Shooting Party</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thorny_Passage\" title=\"Thorny Passage\">Thorny Passage</a>,&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Dim_Forest\" title=\"Dim Forest\">Dim Forest</a>,&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<b>Shooting Party</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Dim_Forest\" title=\"Dim Forest\">Dim Forest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Head to the shooting party's starting location.</li>\n<li>Wait for the shooting party to begin.</li>\n<li>Talk to the Exile leader organizing the shooting party.</li>\n<li>Participate in the Novice Challenge</li>\n<li>Talk to the cunning Exile leader</li>\n<li>Participate in the Intermediate Challenge</li>\n<li>Talk to the cunning Exile leader</li>\n<li>Participate in the Advanced Challenge</li>\n<li>Confront Exile leader</li>\n<li>Defeat the Exiles in the camp</li>\n<li>Claim your rewards</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_notes\">Gameplay notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Part of the <a href=\"/wiki/No_Response_Tonight\" title=\"No Response Tonight\">No Response Tonight</a> quest, complete the steps to unlock.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">You've received an invitation to a peculiar shooting party, seemingly related to the damaged robot in Settle Range. Go check it out.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Head to the location)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Sit down and wait</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the Exile near the ruined building)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Talk</dd>\n<dd><b>Uncaring Exile:</b> We're just here for guard duty! You'll have to find the Boss if you want to talk business!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the Exile near the car)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Talk</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile:</b> Hmph, this will be one helluva score... Hey, what are you sniffing around at? If you're here for something, go take it up with our boss!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Premium Supply Chest</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile:</b> Hey! What are you doing! That's the grand prize for our shooting party! If you want it, earn it yourself!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the Exile leader)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Talk</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Hey, we're running a major shooting tournament and party right now. Come over and join us if you want in on the fun!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Where you come from, what you do for a living. It don't matter. If you think you have a good trigger finger, you can sign up!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> There are three challenges, you'll get yourself some nifty prizes for every challenge you beat. Real simple!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> And the grand prize is right here inside this box next to me!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Three challenges. Get through all of them, and everything here will be all yours!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Whaddya say, wanna give her a spin?</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> (Hehe, that's it, come to papa...)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Come again?\n<dl><dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> N-nothing, it was nothing! Like I said, you sign up, and all the prizes are yours!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I think my shooting skills are up to par.\n<dl><dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Sweet! I knew you had it in you. Right this way, the prizes await!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> And you're in luck, we happen to be offering a 20% discount if you join now! Which comes to a total of... 500 Credits for the sign-up fee!\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You're asking way too much.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Hey, it's only 500 Credits. And you look like you've got more than enough to spare. Just fork it over!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Deliver</dd>\n<dt>(Submit <a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\">Shell Credit</a> x500)</dt>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Hehe, juicy... Money, money, money!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> The targets are ready when you are!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Remember, shooting beyond those scrapped cars counts as instant elimination!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(If you run out of time during the Challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Well, tough luck, pal!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> But since it's your first time, I'll give you another chance!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(After beating the Novice Challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Impressive. That was a quick one!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Come fetch your prizes!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the Exile leader)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Talk</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> What a shot. You're not thinking of just stopping here, are you?</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> How about it, ready for challenge No. 2?</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> You get through two more challenges, and that magnificent prize will be coming home with you!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> This second challenge is designed more for the pros. You get two rounds of targets.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> As for the sign-up fee, hehe... I'll give you another discount. Only 1,000 Credits!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Do you call that a discount?</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> What do you mean? I'm a man of my word, 1000 Credits, hand it over!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Deliver</dd>\n<dt>(Submit <a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\">Shell Credit</a> x1000)</dt>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> I just love chumps... I mean, gracious customers like you!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Step right up! The targets are all set up!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Remember, shooting beyond those scrapped cars counts as instant elimination!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(After beating the Intermediate Challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Squeeze, breathe, and shoot! You're got talent!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Come, come. Your prizes.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> But if you really want the ultimate prize, you better step it up a notch!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> We've had plenty of contestants with decent talent before, but all of them failed to beat the last challenge!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> What do you say? If you want to have a go at the final challenge, come find me!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the Exile leader)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Talk</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Now, the ultimate challenge, is worthy of a master such as yourself. Do you accept this challenge?</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> This final challenge is made up of three rounds worth of targets. You get through all of it, and the grand prize is yours for the taking!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> With a challenge fee of as little as 2,000 Credits! It's make it or break it! Well? Do you have what it takes?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Tired of the acting already?</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Acting? What acting? I'm a man of my word! Come on, then. 2,000 Credits doesn't hurt, it's the ultimate prize we're talking about here!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Deliver</dd>\n<dt>(Submit <a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\">Shell Credit</a> x2000)</dt>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Okay, okay, so much SHC, I made a fortune this time.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Ahem! All right. The stage is all yours!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Same deal as before. Shooting beyond those scrapped cars counts as instant elimination!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(After failing the Advanced Challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Oops. Looks like you failed the challenge! Hahaha!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Aaand... That about wraps it up for today's tournament, folks. Looks like we didn't manage to find a winner this year yet again!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Confront the Exile leader)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Confront</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> What, you got a problem or something?</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> A loss is a loss. Rules are rules!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> The rules were made by you.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> That whole thing is a scam.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Hmph, so what? I didn't plan for any of you suckers to win to begin with.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> This is my turf! Whatever I say goes. Oh, you don't wanna know what happened to that wannabe operator or whatever he was, when we tried to come up against me last time...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You won't get away with this.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You're going down!</dd>\n<dd><b>Cunning Exile Leader:</b> Heh. You got any idea who I am? Let's beat 'em up, fellas!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(After opening the chest)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Legs, Power Module, Moter... Looks like I got all of them. Time to fix up that robot.</dd>\n<dt>(Obtained <span class=\"new\" title=\"Robot Engine (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9ib3RfRW5naW5lP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Robot Engine</span> x1)</dt>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Shooting Party</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">射击派对</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">射擊派對</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji JA Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-n